### Jungle Tempo Default (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when enemy crowd control is light and Yi Sun-shin can convert cooldown reduction into more Weapon Mastery cycles.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst or mixed dive when a shield helps you finish the second weapon cycle before a revive would matter.; Sea Halberd over Immortality when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP frontliners are keeping the first target alive through your mastery burst.; Hunter Strike over Immortality when Use when you are ahead and the game is about chasing through river walls instead of surviving final Lord fights.
- Total cost: 12320 gold

Default jungle setup built around War Axe plus Endless Battle, then Blade of Despair and penetration for decisive mid-game objective fights.

### Jungle Pickoff Snowball (Jungle)

- Items: Magic Boots, War Axe, Endless Battle, Blade of the Heptaseas, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar
- Core: War Axe, Endless Battle, Blade of the Heptaseas
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when the enemy has enough point control to punish the first Traceless commit.; Hunter Strike over Blade of the Heptaseas when Use when fights are extended chases and repeated movement bursts matter more than one Ambush opener.; Sky Piercer over Malefic Roar when Use only while snowballing against low-armor carries when your team can protect your reset after the first kill.; Immortality over Malefic Roar when Use before final Lord fights if one failed ram or melee entry would end the game.
- Total cost: 12160 gold

Snowball setup for pick games where Yi Sun-shin can reveal, isolate one carry, and turn Flame Retribution plus Ambush into a fast first kill.

### Safe Late Game Jungle (Jungle)

